  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.17,
      "end_seconds": 3.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Evening. Let's get started."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.58,
      "end_seconds": 7.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Good morning, uh, doctor, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.96,
      "end_seconds": 11.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "so what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.48,
      "end_seconds": 18.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "It's drenching night sweats. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.93,
      "end_seconds": 24.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "When was the the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.69,
      "end_seconds": 26.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "It's been two days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.15,
      "end_seconds": 31.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.73,
      "end_seconds": 36.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Moderate, really. And I've been feeling run down as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.35,
      "end_seconds": 40.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.59,
      "end_seconds": 43.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Moderate, I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.05,
      "end_seconds": 49.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "let me check a few things any cough, weight loss or diarrhoea?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.51,
      "end_seconds": 54.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "I haven't had cough, weight loss or diarrhoea, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.2,
      "end_seconds": 58.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "And joint pain, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.1,
      "end_seconds": 63.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any joint pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.15,
      "end_seconds": 70.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.23,
      "end_seconds": 73.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.42,
      "end_seconds": 93.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.95,
      "end_seconds": 99.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "I had two stents put in my heart three years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.59,
      "end_seconds": 104.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.34,
      "end_seconds": 112.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "no, not that I know of"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.33,
      "end_seconds": 121.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.69,
      "end_seconds": 134.59,
      "duration_seconds": 11.9,
      "text": "Clopidogrel. I take it 75 milligrams, once a day for the stent. Oh, I take Dolo, 650 milligrams, when I get the fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.7,
      "end_seconds": 138.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.26,
      "end_seconds": 141.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Yes, heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.32,
      "end_seconds": 159.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.0,
      "end_seconds": 164.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.59,
      "end_seconds": 166.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.06,
      "end_seconds": 171.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.18,
      "end_seconds": 182.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.89,
      "end_seconds": 192.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.22,
      "end_seconds": 210.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 123 over 77, pulse 98, temp 38.8 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.65,
      "end_seconds": 215.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Okay, may I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.43,
      "end_seconds": 219.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.33,
      "end_seconds": 240.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.77,
      "text": "There's a firm, rubbery gland about two centimetres in the left armpit, not tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.32,
      "end_seconds": 253.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.39,
      "end_seconds": 292.61,
      "duration_seconds": 35.22,
      "text": "that's all I needed to check. So, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is an enlarged gland with night sweats that needs a proper work-up. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. I'm sending you for an ultrasound of the armpit because of lymph node. I'm sending you for blood tests because of night sweats. Keep a note of your temperature each evening"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.2,
      "end_seconds": 299.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "the haematology clinic would be the right next step, I'll refer you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.56,
      "end_seconds": 305.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.82,
      "end_seconds": 325.62,
      "duration_seconds": 19.8,
      "text": "A chest X-ray is something we might do if this doesn't improve in two weeks. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse. Let's plan a check in a week. Can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.5,
      "end_seconds": 332.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "So, I come back in a week. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.75,
      "end_seconds": 343.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.39,
      "end_seconds": 348.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Actually, okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}